silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_01_probe_catus_collision_concrete_anchor_2#taxrowtsn183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The TaxRowTSN183798 is The ITIS taxonomy row for Felis catus with TSN 183798; a typed node in O_01 with the unique identification arrow lambda_tax into Mittens. This is the admitted source for the taxonomy leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TaxRow_{TSN 183798}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
